co/microsoft/BitNet-embedding-0.6B\"><strong>BitNet-embedding-0.6B</strong></a> and <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/microsoft/BitNet-embedding-270M\"><strong>BitNet-embedding-270M</strong></a> on Hugging Face — the first 1-bit embedding models that deliver competitive embedding quality with significantly faster inference on CPUs.\n - **1.42x to 2.28x speedup** over F16 on BitNet-embedding-0.6B prefill (8 threads)\n - **1.32x to 1.74x speedup** over F16 on BitNet-embedding-270M prefill (8 threads)\n - Supports I2_S conversion with optimized kernels on x86 CPUs"}]}